    x: A `Tensor`. 1-D.
    out_idx: An optional `tf.DType` from: `tf.int32, tf.int64`. Defaults to `tf.int32`.
    name: A name for the operation (optional).

  Returns:
    A tuple of `Tensor` objects (y, idx).

